  "question": {
    "text": "The value of the integral <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mn>60</mn><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is equal to"
  },
